pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# AOT-5 probe: fast travel to a far road, then 100 s of driving with
# alternating steering, no captures. Run with pinyon_shift_cheats=true on a
# private seed; count "First draw with pipeline" log lines and slow frames.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
